        <mxCell id="loss_terms" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;reg: smooth-L1 on best mode · cls: CE, ls=0.2 · endpoint ×1.0 · diversity ×0.05 on endpoints (margin 0.5) · Laplace NLL · neighbor smooth-L1&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontColor=#7B3E38;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=9;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
